Third-party code in this repository and in the images it builds
================================================================

This project is GPL-2.0-only (see COPYING). It contains, patches or bundles the following
third-party work, which keeps its own copyright and license.

Cavium IP forwarding offload module (modules/ipfwd, patches/ipfwd)
    Copyright Cavium Networks / Cavium, Inc. (now Marvell). GPL-2.0.
    From Ubiquiti's EdgeOS GPL source release GPL.octeon.v3.0.0-rc.9.5753459.tar.bz2,
    package ubnt-platform 0.1.18, directory cavium-ipfwd-offload/. patches/ipfwd records every
    change made to it here. Most files carry Cavium's header; export.c, export.h and
    MODULE_LICENSE("GPL") are as Cavium shipped them.

Linux kernel patches (patches/uek7, configs/)
    Against Oracle's Unbreakable Enterprise Kernel (https://github.com/oracle/linux-uek),
    which is Linux and GPL-2.0. Patch 0001 ports Ubiquiti's offload hooks from the EdgeOS GPL
    release's 4.9 kernel.

OpenWrt overlay (openwrt/)
    Target, package Makefiles and patches for OpenWrt (https://openwrt.org), GPL-2.0. The
    patches under openwrt/package/ modify OpenWrt's procd, rpcd and uhttpd (GPL-2.0 / ISC, per
    each package).

OpenWrt device tree (reference/openwrt-dts)
    Copied unmodified from OpenWrt, for reference. GPL-2.0-or-later OR MIT.

