Tailscale service script (openwrt/package/utils/er4-ui/files/tailscale.init)
    From OpenWrt's tailscale package (feeds/packages), Copyright 2020 Google LLC and
    CZ.NIC z.s.p.o. Apache-2.0, as its header says; changed for the ER-4.

Tailscale (not in this repository or the image)
    The router downloads Tailscale's official static build from pkgs.tailscale.com when
    Tailscale is set up (er4-tailscale-fetch). Tailscale is BSD-3-Clause, Copyright Tailscale Inc.
    and contributors (https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale).

Time zone rules (openwrt/package/utils/er4-ui/files/zoneinfo.json)
    Generated by tools/gen-zoneinfo.py from the IANA time zone database (tzdata), which is in
    the public domain.

Cross toolchain (downloaded by tools/kernel-config.sh, not in this repository)
    Bootlin toolchain mips64-n32--glibc--stable-2021.11-1 (https://toolchains.bootlin.com),
    under its own licenses. Only used to generate the kernel config.
